// time as mcp.<server>.<tool> (server and tool normalized to [a-z0-9_]), so
// policy and audit see one id space with the declared operations. This file
// models the payload shapes of such a call. The messages carry no operation
// option (the id is per tool, not per message) and there is no runtime
// routing: the harness makes every call and kei-proxy stays decision-only
